# nita

--- Shaman_PetSlam | gadget | TID_SHAMAN_BUDDY_GADGET_1_DESC
raw  Nita commands her bear to slam the ground, stunning all enemies within its reach. Her bear gains <!buddy.accessory.value1>% damage for its next attack.
now  Nita commands her bear to slam the ground, stunning all enemies within its reach. Her bear gains 50% damage for its next attack.
  buddy.accessory.value1  50  -> 50

