--- Shaman_overcharge | hypercharge | TID_SHAMAN_OVERCHARGE_DESC
raw  Nita Hypercharges Bruce, making him increase in size, giving him <VALUE3>% increased movement speed and <VALUE1>% increased health.
now  Nita Hypercharges Bruce, making him increase in size, giving him 150% increased movement speed and 20% increased health.
  VALUE3  150  -> 15
  VALUE1  20  -> 20

--- Shaman_unique | star power | TID_SPEC_ABI_PET_LIFESTEAL_DESC
raw  Nita recovers <VALUE1> health whenever her bear hits an enemy Brawler. When Nita deals damage to an enemy Brawler, her bear regains <VALUE2> health.
now  Nita recovers 137 health whenever her bear hits an enemy Brawler. When Nita deals damage to an enemy Brawler, her bear regains 57 health.
  VALUE1  137  -> 1096
  VALUE2  57  -> 1094

--- Shaman_unique | star power | TID_SHAMAN_BUDDY_STARPOWER_1_DESC
raw  Nita recovers <!card.value1.petdamagepercent> health whenever her bear hits an enemy Brawler. When Nita deals damage to an enemy Brawler, her bear regains <!card.value2.characterdamagepercent> health. This ability can overheal Nita or her bear for 2000 health.
now  Nita recovers <!card.value1.petdamagepercent> health whenever her bear hits an enemy Brawler. When Nita deals damage to an enemy Brawler, her bear regains <!card.value2.characterdamagepercent> health. This ability can overheal Nita or her bear for 2000 health.
  card.value1.petdamagepercent  -  -> 1096
  card.value2.characterdamagepercent  -  -> 1094

