  card.value1  60  -> 60
  buddy.trait.statusEffect.decreaseReloadTimePercent  25  -> 25
  buddy.trait.statusEffect.duration.ticksAsSeconds  3  -> 3

--- Shaman_unique_2 | star power | TID_SHAMAN_BUDDY_STARPOWER_2_DIFF
